# Wiring Guide

Complete wiring instructions for NikolaChrono.

> **Safety First**
>
> - **RTC: 3.3V ONLY.** Connect the DS3231 VCC pin to ESP32 3V3. Do not connect it to 5V.
> - **LCD: 5V ONLY.** Connect the 16x2 I2C LCD module VCC to ESP32 VIN (5V) for best brightness. Verify I2C signal voltage compatibility before connecting it to the ESP32.
> - **Common ground:** Connect the grounds of the ESP32, RTC, LCD, TM1637, buttons, buzzer, and LED circuit together.

