| MINUS button, pin 2 | GND | Ground | Connect to common ground |
| SNOOZE button, pin 1 | GPIO 13 | Digital input | Uses `INPUT_PULLUP` |
| SNOOZE button, pin 2 | GND | Ground | Connect to common ground |
